        "content": "## AI Lead Qualifier \u2192 Slack\nPOST your form submission JSON here (name, email, company, message, budget...). Hot leads (score \u226570) are pinged to Slack.\n\n1. Create a Header Auth credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_KEY`.\n2. Select it on the **LLM** node.\n3. Edit model/base URL in **Config**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 340
